      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING GODDESS (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (23.47) in a Grade 3/4 at this track. Form at the trip sound including 10 wins. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Should bounce back. RED TAPE (3) goes very well this trip starting 16 times for six wins and three minors. Below best last time at this track (23.72) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 11 length eighth. Looks one of the chances. GRETZKY (7) ran a strong 22.80 when filling a minor placing over 400m at this track last start. Bold showing expected again. MY MOON SHADOW (2) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
